# OTA binaries
*.bin
*.bin.sha256
*.bin.sig
*.bin.ota.json
*.elf
*.map
# [P0-4 AUDIT 2026-09] Binaries are NOT source — they are immutable build
# artifacts distributed via GitHub Releases / Actions artifacts. The previous
# `!firmware-generic/bin/*.bin` exception caused binary drift (audit-7: two
# v1.7.1 binaries differed by 144 bytes between Firmware repo and PWA repo).
# Removing the exception stops source repo from tracking binaries; CI now
# builds + signs + uploads to GitHub Release on tag.

# Logs
*.log
dev.log
server.log

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
# Push-alarm MonitorIoT: roots.pem adalah bundel sertifikat CA
# PUBLIK (GTS Root R1+R4) untuk verifikasi TLS firmware - bukan
# rahasia, wajib ter-commit.
!push-alarm/firmware/tools/roots.pem

